                                        "entry_id": "0a98c2bc-90c0-3023-a76a-bb50903fb5b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any ocean-going cargo vessel (merchant ship) designed to carry unpackaged bulk cargo, such as grains, coal, ore, steel coils and cement, in its holds."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6169c888-94da-4eef-bc4b-7f44485d2a5a",
                                                "sense_id": "3124b9e7-8a7c-37ab-a14a-df002c374edc",
                                                "text": "Otherwise, overseas coking coal will be moved to the UK by bulk ocean carrier, which are among the filthiest polluting objects on the face of the Earth we seek to protect."
                                            }
